      "body": "## Motivation\n\nNative `Generate` now carries `image_data` (#42833). When the tokenizer manager cannot fetch or decode an image, it raises `ValueError`, and `RuntimeHandle._run_generate` turns every exception into `_send_native_error`, so the client gets gRPC `INTERNAL` (HTTP 500 at a gateway) for what is a bad request. HTTP `/generate` returns 400 for the same input.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- `_run_generate` catches `ValueError` and finishes the stream with the tokenizer manager's abort shape: `finish_reason = {\"type\": \"abort\", \"status_code\": 400, \"err_type\": \"BadRequestError\", \"message\": ...}`.\n- Any other exception still goes through `_send_native_error` (INTERNAL).\n\n## Tests\n\n- `test/registered/unit/entrypoints/test_grpc_bridge.py`: 7 passed, 2 new (`TestNativeGrpcErrors`: a `ValueError` yields one terminal 400 abort chunk, streaming and not; a `RuntimeError` stays an error).\n- `pre-commit run` on the changed files: clean.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39654403894](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39654403894)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39654403717](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39654403717)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39654403936](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39654403936)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
